     "text": "What is Green Wednesday?"
    },
    {
     "t": "meta",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "November 20, 2023",
       "href": "/2023/11/20/"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 1,
   "id": "1be748f",
   "doc": "single-post#6157",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Green Wednesday"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>The cannabis industry’s “Black Friday” gives customers a chance to stock up before the Thanksgiving festivities. You’ll be able to find specials galore across all tiers and types of <a href=\"/menu/\">cannabis products</a>. With all the specials, it’s a perfect opportunity to try out that top shelf bud you’ve been eyeing or maybe it’s time to dip your toes into the world of <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a>, the possibilities are endless!</p><p>The cannabis industry has seen a major uptick in sales the day before Thanksgiving since the start of legalization. Around 2016, retailers began offering specials to celebrate this unofficial holiday which soon became known as <strong><em>“Green Wednesday”</em></strong>. It’s the second busiest day of the year for the cannabis industry, only surpassed by 4/20. Everyone and their uncle wants a little something for the pre-Thanksgiving dinner walk and Green Wednesday is the day to get it.</p><p>With the holidays revolving around family, there are times cannabis consumption has to be kept discrete, this has become significantly easier over the years of legalization. <a href=\"/categories/edibles/drinks/\">Infused drinks</a> are a top choice among cannabis consumers across the board with water soluble <a href=\"/categories/tinctures/\">tinctures</a> for higher dose consumers and pre-mixed single serving drinks for a more casual experience. Being around family or hosting can be a stressful event and it may be nice to unwind with an edible. We’re seeing more cannabinoids coming to the market such as CBG to potentially aid in a more relaxed mellow mood in tense times. If you’re looking to potentially help liven up the conversation THCv is a pleasantly energetic contender.</p><p>The potential for extra savings opens up the option to splurge and try new products that you wouldn’t normally. If you’re a fan of <a href=\"/shop-high-testing-flower/\">higher testing products</a> it’s always fun to get a few loved ones together and roll your own infused joint with a distillate syringe and THCa isolate! If you’re looking for something a bit more discrete but still potent; <a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/\">vaporizer cartridges</a> are always a convenient choice for a sneaky hit or two.</p><p><em><strong>Green Wednesday</strong> </em>embodies the gratitude that we all feel for cannabis. <em>Take the day to celebrate, spread the love and blaze on!</em></p>"
    }
   ]
  },
